    "updated_at": "2018-02-02T11:10:47Z",
    "body": "Definitely the simpler thing.  Having inconsistent attribute handling in parser feels rather bad.\r\nThat does mean inconsistency in serializer, but I guess I'd rather take that.\r\nSomething like, when serializing, and there isn't is attribute set explicitly, but the element is customized built-in, inject is attribute.",
